WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:06.150
Poles came to mourn the man who led their
city for two decades.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:12.990
Pavel Adam-OH-vitch, a husband and father,
was one of the country's progressive voices.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:22.300
EU council president Donald Tusk flew to Gdansk,
his hometown, to honor his friend:

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:28.619
I want to promise you today, dear Pawel, on
behalf of all of us – Gdansk residents,

00:00:28.619 --> 00:00:36.190
Poles and Europeans – that for you and for
all of us we will defend our Gdansk, our Poland

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:41.429
and our Europe against hatred and contempt,
we promise you this.

00:00:41.429 --> 00:00:44.510
Farewell Pawel.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:53.949
Many people knew him personally:
For me it's terrible news, especially since

00:00:53.949 --> 00:00:56.829
we went to grade school together, just over
there.

00:00:56.829 --> 00:00:59.620
I thought he would survive.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.280
I'm physically devastated.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:10.450
I'm very sad because I saw the mayor very
often.

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:16.829
On Sunday, PA-vel Adam-OH-vitch was praising
a fundraising effort for children in need.

00:01:16.829 --> 00:01:28.220
As the mayor looked out at thousands of people,
a man lunged at him with a knife.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:32.920
The attacker then remained on stage, shouting
that he blamed the mayor's former party for

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:34.710
wrongfully imprisoning him.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:38.810
Then he was tackled to the ground.

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:49.979
Prosecutors are charging the 27-year-old suspect
with murder.

00:01:49.979 --> 00:02:04.409
Just before his death, Adamowicz called Gdansk
the

00:02:04.409 --> 00:02:18.379
most wonderful city in

00:02:18.379 --> 00:02:20.460
the world.

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:34.340
A

00:02:34.340 --> 00:05:36.590
lasting message to the people he served.

